id: magic-orb
name: Magic Orb
kind: crafting
weaponType: magic
possesses: spiritual-weapon
source: Core Rule
description: >
  It has Spiritual Weapon, outside its Quality Slots. Attacks with it 2(T) higher on the Wound
  Roll.
text: >
  Magic Orb: This Weapon allows you to see your enemies from far away.
  –Effects: This Weapon possesses the Spiritual Weapon Quality (this Weapon Quality does not
  count towards your Quality Slots). Additionally, increase the Wound Rolls of Attacking
  Maneuvers with this Weapon by 2(T).

---

[passive]
weapon.wound += 2(T);
